     "tipo": "dialogo",
     "titulo": "Dialogue: coordinating at work",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "工作中遇到「工作报告」的问题，你会先跟谁商量？",
       "alumno": "If a problem related to «work reports» comes up at work, who would you talk to first?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我把这个问题分成了几个方面，也整理了各自的原因。",
       "alumno": "I have divided the problem into several aspects and organised the causes of each.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "你觉得哪个方面更重要？",
       "alumno": "Which aspect do you think is more important?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "其实，我们应该先比较这两个方面，再选择解决办法。",
       "alumno": "Actually, we should first compare these two aspects before choosing a solution.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "你会根据什么标准来比较？",
       "alumno": "What criteria would you use to compare them?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "先看实际效果，再考虑成本和可能的影响。",
       "alumno": "I would look first at the actual results, then consider the cost and the possible impact.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Reading: coordinating at work",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "处理工作中的「工作报告」，需要明确分工和时间安排。",
       "alumno": "Dealing with «work reports» at work requires clarifying responsibilities and timelines.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "遇到变化时，及时沟通通常比等到最后补救更有效。",
       "alumno": "When circumstances change, communicating in time is usually more effective than patching things up at the last minute.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "不同来源有时会强调问题的不同方面，比较它们有助于发现遗漏。",
       "alumno": "Sometimes different sources stress different aspects of a problem; comparing them helps to spot what is missing.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "写作时要解释这些材料如何支持主要观点。",
       "alumno": "When writing, explain how these materials support the main idea.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
